./ R 00170000 00200000 $ 00170100 100                                           
*  RUN UNIPROCESSOR. THE AP=YES PATH MAKES DMKCPI EXECUTE      XA0014DK         
*  CONCS, WHICH IS S/370-ONLY AND WOULD TAKE AN OPERATION      XA0014DK         
*  EXCEPTION AT IPL. CHANNEL SETS DO NOT EXIST IN THE CHANNEL  XA0014DK         
*  SUBSYSTEM AT ALL -- EVERY CPU CAN ADDRESS EVERY SUBCHANNEL  XA0014DK         
*  -- SO THE AP I/O MODEL IS OBSOLETE RATHER THAN BROKEN, AND  XA0014DK         
*  RE-ENABLING IT IS A REDESIGN, NOT A DECK. THE PROCESSOR     XA0014DK         
*  HALF IS UNAFFECTED: SIGP, SPX, STPX, STAP AND SPT ARE       XA0014DK         
*  VALID IN ALL THREE ARCHITECTURES. HERCULES IS NUMCPU 1      XA0014DK         
*  REGARDLESS. EIGHT MODULES ALREADY BRANCH ON DMKSYSAP, SO    XA0014DK         
*  AP=NO IS A SUPPORTED CONFIGURATION. TO REVERT: DROP THIS    XA0014DK         
*  DECK FROM DMKSYS AUXLCL. I-50.                              XA0014DK         
         SYSCOR RMSIZE=16384K,AP=NO                            XA0014DK         
